        rate/H_0 = sqrt(3 Omega_d a^-3 / c_14);  at c_14 = 1e-5:  a = 1 -> 282.5 H_0,  a = 0.01 -> 2.82e+05 H_0
        g03w published:                                                   282 H_0            2.8e+05 H_0
